# sa535m_emac0_rgmii

Switches EMAC0 on SA535M to RGMII for use with a Micrel PHY.

## Platform
- SoC: SA535M (`msm-id = 703`)
- Board variants: EMMC TDP (`0x10030 0x0`), NAND TDP (`0x10030 0x20000`)

## EMAC0
- Interface: RGMII (`rgmii-rxid`)
- PHY: Micrel, MDIO address `0x7`
- PHY reset: GPIO 75 (active low, 1 ms assert / 10 ms deassert delay)
